From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:35:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reclaim idle dynamic Workers and remove failed loads

Coworkerd v30; depends on the v29 CPU hooks and native Binding patch. Upstream v1.20261012.1 exposes lifetime and teardown hooks; no files outside server are changed.

